ri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312373_1363239738226092_2106854729412937022_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UIW-wDhrlqoQ7kNvwGX_wNL&_nc_oc=AdrKAmcU7SQ76_evYIGetYOttDH1JdDt59tFwl1yjn5wG56dx5rE3IR4uI5cS2rCeEI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJQW0zJucq9u2lWaaTjxfrQuGLLsNU1ONnp06LLFVawng&oe=6AAEB52E"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image_02.png", "id": "1188201992987967", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295509_1188201996321300_2111120103698102006_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sJKVv35zMiUQ7kNvwFiEoeJ&_nc_oc=Adpu-JgXz-F6_psHwdEsOznUATCjmoqVKWCw8og3jc43OqgsYDhAJLLqxXd9ycJUMUI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIAYcV5ep7Cgppw73MkkfFxxHPGaZRWaQhUFW6guok41Q&oe=6AAEA98A"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image_02.png", "id": "1737987487068873", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295801_1737987493735539_1039395962667216685_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YmjusNKtoooQ7kNvwH68uxx&_nc_oc=AdrlYjZAAsn5o_6jgCndPXohBSTSQ8QB_ryX34S5zPG10TeVqC7a2DKtjyVyKqCgg98&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKVbVCKxHz9_socRi5cPjbLhR5Gk9pOUgRPGuGBm3tuKQ&oe=6AAE98AB"}, {"file_name": "DodgeLasers_02.png", "id": "3637904013182167", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294007_3637904023182166_4032639804070807573_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pf-kvZ1avkoQ7kNvwEO70jE&_nc_oc=AdpzgJKev-m5IjabwiNIgFxjhrVoyb8gQCIq7k-Ctym3Z0tcTHWeeRPQRH1prMl-HYQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJtcWIdm417upDY7WwNCwxPll9r2Sh-ragEwD_04pDImQ&oe=6AAE85B1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Landscape_New.png", "id": "898823102474350", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_898823109141016_4587002048357409884_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZShRhrLHH9IQ7kNvwHW4xA6&_nc_oc=AdpZplz5AlXYCndk-TCgK7zVmK4EynRI9WlyyBSReKrWWEGwiWF51RXFwspgVS8uvJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJoaI7hEkopNYLekLkuzdgMwtsh9HgYeOH7CQc_6WyLRA&oe=6AAE8578"}, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Punch Bomb\nis a fast-paced 360\u00b0 action arcade game where you punch bombs away before they explode.\n\nBuilt for those who love a challenge.\n\nClimb the global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Classic Mode\nSurvive as long as you can! Punch a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, dodge dangerous laser obstacles, hit targets, and rack up huge combos.\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRace against the clock to get a high score within the time limit! Bombs no longer explode, and targets extend your time. \n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock unique cosmetics by **playing the game** and mastering its challenges. Each cosmetic has its own visual flair!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Punch bombs away from you before they explode while racking up combos, dodging dangerous laser obstacles, and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "